            "value": {
                "none": [
                    "[English version]  At a general meeting of painters and sculptors, it is decided to celebrate the feast day of Saint Luke and the Forty Hours. The festival organizers are elected for this purpose.    [Italian version]  La congregazione generale dei pittori e scultori decide di celebrare la festa di San Luca e le 40 ore. A tale scopo vengono eletti i festaroli."
